      "text": [
        " لَا يَأْبَ الشُّهَدَاءُ أَنْ تُجِيبَ حِينَ تُدْعَى قَبْلَ الْكِتَابِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "A number of our companions, from sahl Bin Ziyad, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad Bin Abu Nasr, from Dawood Bin Sirhan, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘The witnesses should not refuse to answer when they are summoned before the writing (documenting)’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "6. A number of our people have narrated from Sahl ibn Ziyad Ahmad ibn Muhammad from ibn abu Nasr from Dawud ibn Sarhan who has narrated the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said, ‘Witnesses must not refuse to present their testimony when they are called before it (the case and testimony) is written down.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
